User Request:  
"On our Nokia 7750 SR setup, after a router hiccup during graceful recovery, stale BGP paths aren’t propagating to external neighbors. How do I adjust the config so these lingering routes stick around and get shared with everyone, including peers outside our own network, during the extended grace window?"

