## Proposed answer:
To configure the router to resolve next-hops for unused private network routes (VPN-IPv4 and VPN-IPv6), use the following command:

```
configure router bgp
    enable-rr-vpn-forwarding
```

This command imports all received VPN-IP routes into a dummy VRF, allowing BGP next-hop resolution regardless of route targets. Ensure the `label-route-transport-tunnel` under `config>router>bgp>next-hop-resolution` is configured to specify eligible tunnel types for next-hop resolution.
