```

**Key details:**
1. `family ipv4`: Enables only basic IPv4 route exchange
2. `no graceful-restart`: Disables BGP graceful restart capabilities
3. `no extended-nh-encoding`: Prevents advertising extended next-hop features
4. `no third-party-nexthop`: Disables third-party next-hop optimizations

Replace `<LEGACY_DEVICE_AS_NUM>` with the actual AS number of your legacy device. This configuration ensures only standard IPv4 BGP (RFC 4271) features are used during session establishment and route exchange.
