    neighbor <neighbor2-ip> group "EU-West-1"
    exit
exit
```

Replace `<neighbor1-ip>` and `<neighbor2-ip>` with the actual IP addresses of your external neighbors. This creates an external BGP group named `EU-West-1` and assigns the specified neighbors to this group for simplified route sharing and common policy application.
