To enable both pre-policy and post-policy route status updates on your Nokia 7750 SR, use the following CLI configuration:

```cli
configure router bgp
    monitor
        route-monitoring pre-policy post-policy
    exit
exit
```

**Explanation:**  
- The `route-monitoring` command under BGP monitor configuration enables BMP to send route updates.  
- `pre-policy` captures routes before any BGP policies are applied.  
- `post-policy` captures routes after all policies and rules have been processed.  
- This configuration applies globally to the BGP instance. To target specific groups or neighbors, apply the same command under `group>monitor` or `neighbor>monitor` contexts.
