- `peer-tracking-policy "core-routes"` applies your policy to evaluate route availability in the routing table.  
- `enable-peer-tracking` forces immediate BGP session teardown if routes permitted by "core-routes" disappear, bypassing hold timer delays.  

**Verification:**  
