To enable near-instant BGP updates for IPv6 multicast VPN routes on your Nokia 7750 SR during multicast group changes, configure BGP Add-Paths for the MVPN IPv6 address family. Use the following commands:

```
configure router bgp
group <group-name>
neighbor <neighbor-ip>
    add-paths
        mvpn-ipv6 send 16 receive
    exit
```

Replace `<group-name>` and `<neighbor-ip>` with your BGP group and neighbor IP. This configuration allows advertising multiple paths per prefix (up to 16) and enables receiving multiple paths, accelerating route propagation during join/leave events.
