To ensure BGP uses SR-stitched paths from a less-preferred OSPF instance for next-hop resolution:

```cli
configure router bgp
    next-hop-resolution
        shortcut-tunn
            family ipv4
                resolution-filter sr-ospf
            exit
        exit
    exit
exit
