To restrict BGP next-hop resolution to specific tunnel types, configure a resolution filter under the relevant BGP next-hop resolution contexts. Below are the CLI commands to remove all tunnel types and then explicitly enable only your desired ones (replace `sr-desired-tunnel` with your chosen types like `sr-te`, `sr-isis`, etc.):

